<title>UK: Essen Hypo adds 100 mln mark to step-up Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo adds 100 mln mark to step-up Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager Commerzbank, has been increased to 200</p>
<p>million marks from 100 million marks.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.125     MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    23.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 22.JUL.97 WHEN CALLABLE AT PAR. IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		THEN STEPS-UP TO 5.0 PCT.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 456.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
